WEBVTT

00:01:47.066 --> 00:01:48.066
Flying Dragons, huh?

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:50.730
Now we can get to the fortress!

00:01:51.033 --> 00:01:52.803
Good luck, Zola.

00:01:54.166 --> 00:01:55.966
I leave the enemies
on the ground to you.

00:01:56.733 --> 00:02:01.033
And one more thing.
There's something I must tell all of you.

00:02:01.266 --> 00:02:04.296
The identity of the seventh
Soldier of Light...

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:06.470
is Nene.

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:08.030
That can't be!

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:11.800
Everyone, ascend!
We'll go around to the top of the fortress!

00:02:12.266 --> 00:02:13.266
- Roger!
- Roger!

00:02:14.766 --> 00:02:17.426
Bring them down!
Bring them down no matter what it takes!

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:20.500
Don't let them get
any closer to the Galleon!

00:02:23.533 --> 00:02:25.533
The enemy has infiltrated the Galleon!

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:27.430
They're moving into the S Field!

00:02:31.133 --> 00:02:33.573
Modified Black Shadow Type Three...

00:02:34.033 --> 00:02:35.033
Activate!

00:02:56.733 --> 00:03:02.503
It's futile. It's only a matter of time before
they use up all of their strength.

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:04.500
Lord Szabo!

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:06.400
I'm busy right now...

00:03:06.433 --> 00:03:08.333
I have brought Lord Nene!

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:14.030
Lord Nene, did you come here
to finish them off yourself?

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:15.070
No.

00:03:15.166 --> 00:03:18.626
Then you came to witness
their end close up?

00:03:18.833 --> 00:03:20.303
That's not it, either.

00:03:21.033 --> 00:03:22.603
I came to defeat you!

00:03:22.766 --> 00:03:25.326
Hipopon, Hipotama, Transform!

00:03:25.533 --> 00:03:28.073
Turn into the Modified
Black Shadow Type Three!

00:03:29.933 --> 00:03:31.233
Here we go!

00:03:31.833 --> 00:03:33.873
- Fire T3 Beam!
- Fire T3 Beam!

00:03:33.966 --> 00:03:35.596
Go!

00:03:38.266 --> 00:03:41.896
This could really be
the end of me this time!

00:03:51.566 --> 00:03:52.766
So you've come, eh?

00:03:53.233 --> 00:03:58.133
AERIAL FORTRESS SHOWDOWN

00:04:02.666 --> 00:04:05.326
We've finally arrived before Nene.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:09.230
My long journey ends here.

00:04:13.433 --> 00:04:14.733
With this battle...

00:04:16.533 --> 00:04:20.233
My journey of vengeance...
I will bring an end to it here today!

00:04:26.833 --> 00:04:28.973
We are not the same
as we used to be...

00:04:32.133 --> 00:04:33.903
This time, we will defeat...

00:04:34.733 --> 00:04:35.403
Nene!

00:04:39.066 --> 00:04:40.826
- For sure!
- For sure!

00:04:43.766 --> 00:04:47.196
Seems like you are all ready, huh?

00:04:47.233 --> 00:04:48.603
Huh? Huh?

00:04:49.133 --> 00:04:53.373
I suppose taking you on in the halfhearted
way I did before would just be insulting now.

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:55.200
An insult! An insult!

00:04:55.833 --> 00:05:00.533
This time, we won't let you run away
like you did back at Bouquet's ruins.

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:05.400
We are here to defeat you!

00:05:05.766 --> 00:05:07.866
We'll settle this once and for all, Nene!

00:05:23.433 --> 00:05:25.233
Now then, come and get it!

00:05:25.533 --> 00:05:28.533
We'll go full force!
We'll hit him with everything we've got!

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:34.000
Hipopon, Hipotama, Transform!
Turn into the Black Shadow Type Three!

00:05:35.233 --> 00:05:38.133
Fire T3 Beam!

00:05:38.166 --> 00:05:39.396
Maro!

00:05:39.433 --> 00:05:41.033
Eternal Breath!

00:05:46.866 --> 00:05:47.926
Waves of Rage!

00:05:51.266 --> 00:05:52.526
Why you!

00:05:56.133 --> 00:05:57.873
Hornet Assassin!

00:06:03.833 --> 00:06:05.603
Fire Crisis!

00:06:10.833 --> 00:06:12.273
Did that do it?!

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:13.800
I don't think so.

00:06:13.933 --> 00:06:17.133
If it were that easy, we wouldn't
have had much trouble to begin with.

00:06:27.333 --> 00:06:29.273
He hasn't got a scratch on him.

00:06:30.233 --> 00:06:31.273
No way.

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:35.970
We scored the initial attack!
Let's keep going!

00:06:36.233 --> 00:06:36.903
- Right!
- Right!

00:06:37.466 --> 00:06:39.426
Marumaro and Kluke,
come with me to the right.

00:06:40.233 --> 00:06:42.433
Shu, Jiro, and Bouquet,
you attack from the left!

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:52.370
Here goes!

00:06:56.900 --> 00:06:58.400
Eye Beam!

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:03.670
Hornet Assassin!

00:07:14.366 --> 00:07:15.826
Ray Stinger!

00:07:35.066 --> 00:07:35.726
We got him!

00:07:37.066 --> 00:07:39.696
Stay focused!
We only landed one punch.

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:41.330
I... I know that!

00:07:43.433 --> 00:07:46.903
Just what I'd expect from
the descendants of the Soldiers of Light.

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:48.670
Descendants! Descendants!

00:07:49.066 --> 00:07:52.226
Even the great Nene seems
to find us formidable, huh?

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:53.430
What did you say?!

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:54.930
You say! You say!

00:07:55.266 --> 00:08:00.226
Isn't it a bit too much for you
to take on all six of us at once?

00:08:04.033 --> 00:08:08.103
I thought I told you long ago.
It isn't sheer numbers that matter.

00:08:08.266 --> 00:08:09.996
What matters is strength!

00:08:10.033 --> 00:08:11.533
Strength! Strength!

00:08:11.566 --> 00:08:12.996
What nonsense...

00:08:13.033 --> 00:08:14.433
It's a pity, Zola.

00:08:14.666 --> 00:08:20.426
I thought I taught you many things,
but it seems it was all for nothing.

00:08:20.533 --> 00:08:24.303
So, how does it feel to have
your hand bitten by the dog you fed?

00:08:24.566 --> 00:08:26.666
You'll need more than
words to beat me.

00:08:27.833 --> 00:08:29.903
You were talking about numbers,
were you not?

00:08:30.233 --> 00:08:31.233
What?!

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:33.800
Then how do you feel about this?

00:08:33.833 --> 00:08:35.133
About this! About this!

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:41.770
Shadow Multiply!

00:08:52.966 --> 00:08:54.296
The Shadow split into seven.

00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:56.470
I have a bad feeling about this...

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:59.630
So in terms of numbers, I've won.

00:08:59.666 --> 00:09:01.096
I've won! I've won!

00:09:01.466 --> 00:09:02.696
Have you lost your mind?

00:09:03.033 --> 00:09:07.933
No ordinary person could control
seven Shadows at the same time!

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:11.100
Indeed. No ordinary person could...

00:09:18.266 --> 00:09:20.096
No!

00:09:33.066 --> 00:09:34.066
You!

00:09:34.533 --> 00:09:36.603
He is in complete control?!

00:09:38.666 --> 00:09:40.196
Let us begin.

00:10:06.333 --> 00:10:08.473
Are you not going to launch an attack?

00:10:09.066 --> 00:10:11.066
We are preparing as fast as we can.

00:10:11.233 --> 00:10:13.373
It doesn't look that way to me...

00:10:13.633 --> 00:10:15.933
There is a problem with my ship...

00:10:16.366 --> 00:10:19.126
We couldn't possibly send out
a squadron without its flagship

00:10:19.166 --> 00:10:21.426
to Lord Nene's presence,
now can we?

00:10:23.066 --> 00:10:24.496
A report has come in.

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:28.130
Lord Nene is confronting
the Shadow Wielders.

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:30.330
How unfortunate.

00:10:30.666 --> 00:10:33.166
I had wished to join the battle, but...

00:10:35.433 --> 00:10:37.403
The one you'd fight against is...

00:10:38.966 --> 00:10:41.226
No... It was nothing.

00:10:43.033 --> 00:10:48.833
Whichever side prevails, this battle will
greatly affect the course of the future.

00:10:48.866 --> 00:10:51.026
And when that time comes, then...

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:56.870
General Logi....

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:01.370
It's inconceivable that
Lord Nene could lose...

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:06.170
There seems to be no merit to
his plan of waiting to see what happens...

00:11:07.033 --> 00:11:08.203
What on earth?

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:24.630
Keep your distance!
No one could keep up this reckless attack!

00:11:27.466 --> 00:11:30.466
Are you still thinking
inside the box, Zola?

00:11:30.533 --> 00:11:31.633
Zola! Zola!

00:11:31.666 --> 00:11:32.796
What do you mean?!

00:11:33.066 --> 00:11:34.296
Have you forgotten?

00:11:34.566 --> 00:11:37.426
That I have the assistance
of the children?

00:11:40.266 --> 00:11:43.966
Even as we speak,
their strength is flowing into me.

00:11:44.333 --> 00:11:50.733
So as long as I have them,
I can unleash unlimited amounts of power.

00:11:56.766 --> 00:11:57.866
You!

00:11:58.000 --> 00:11:59.730
Why so angry?

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:01.670
Nene!

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:09.100
How foolish.

00:12:09.266 --> 00:12:10.266
What?

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:11.670
But isn't it true?

00:12:11.900 --> 00:12:16.070
Letting your emotions get the better of you,
losing your cool and rushing in blindly.

00:12:16.566 --> 00:12:19.166
How else shall I describe it?

00:12:19.833 --> 00:12:23.273
Zola, I wonder what's holding you back.

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:25.000
Holding me back?

00:12:25.366 --> 00:12:26.766
But isn't that the case?

00:12:27.233 --> 00:12:32.003
Something is holding you back from
unleashing the true power you hold in.

00:12:37.033 --> 00:12:41.033
Sense of justice? Friends?
Family? The past?

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:45.030
You have so many things
that could be holding you back.

00:12:45.966 --> 00:12:47.766
What a shallow question!

00:12:49.566 --> 00:12:53.596
Zola, just what is it that
you're trying to do?

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:55.070
So that's it, after all.

00:12:55.933 --> 00:12:57.303
You really don't know, huh?

00:12:58.600 --> 00:13:00.230
Then I'll give you a hint.

00:13:00.533 --> 00:13:07.073
Justice? Friends? Family? The past?
I have no interest in any of it.

00:13:07.566 --> 00:13:08.596
What?

00:13:08.733 --> 00:13:10.433
Think hard.

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:14.000
What do you think was the reason
we parted ways back then?

00:13:19.433 --> 00:13:22.533
You're dense.
I'm talking about the accident.

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:23.800
The accident?

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:38.170
In that place...

00:13:40.166 --> 00:13:42.196
After that accident,

00:13:45.633 --> 00:13:48.273
you simply went missing.

00:13:50.466 --> 00:13:51.466
But...

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:56.800
after five long years
of not hearing from you,

00:13:56.833 --> 00:13:59.133
you suddenly returned to me.

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:07.700
I took you in,
but your objective was not to join me.

00:14:08.100 --> 00:14:11.370
It was to steal the fruits of my research.

00:14:15.066 --> 00:14:17.366
Zola, you betrayed me!

00:14:17.533 --> 00:14:19.573
No, you're wrong.

00:14:20.833 --> 00:14:25.133
We were never on the same side
now that I think about it.

00:14:25.533 --> 00:14:31.873
You awakened your powers and chose to
exercise them solely for your own gain.

00:14:32.066 --> 00:14:33.426
What happened to you?!

00:14:34.533 --> 00:14:38.003
Zola, what on earth happened
to you in that place?

00:14:39.300 --> 00:14:40.300
I wonder...

00:14:40.533 --> 00:14:41.203
Zola!

00:14:42.266 --> 00:14:45.226
I just want to see it with my own eyes.

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:46.830
The future.

00:14:47.100 --> 00:14:47.770
The future?!

00:14:48.033 --> 00:14:52.303
Yes, the future.
And you are in the way!

00:14:52.733 --> 00:14:54.503
For something like that?

00:14:54.533 --> 00:14:59.073
Yes. And I will defeat you, Nene!

00:14:59.166 --> 00:15:02.326
Then I will crush you, future and all!

00:15:02.366 --> 00:15:03.826
I will, I will!

00:15:05.366 --> 00:15:07.066
Graviton Ball!

00:15:11.466 --> 00:15:12.466
What?!

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:14.770
Three special attacks at once?!

00:15:15.066 --> 00:15:16.926
Phoenix! Cover for Zola!

00:15:17.233 --> 00:15:19.903
Hippo, we'll take on that attack!

00:15:19.933 --> 00:15:22.473
T-That's impossible! We'll get killed!

00:15:25.866 --> 00:15:27.166
Kluke! Bouquet!

00:15:27.333 --> 00:15:32.773
I have all of your combat data already.
Sorry, but just remain quiet.

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:34.600
Shu, Marumaro! Cover her!

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:35.800
We know!

00:15:35.966 --> 00:15:36.966
Maro!

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:40.970
Don't get in the way.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:42.470
Don't! Don't!

00:15:42.966 --> 00:15:44.626
Die, Zola.

00:15:44.766 --> 00:15:47.126
Only a fool would take a beating
without putting up some fight!

00:15:58.933 --> 00:15:59.933
Damn it!

00:15:59.966 --> 00:16:00.696
Zola!

00:16:05.966 --> 00:16:07.666
- Zola!
- Zola!

00:16:21.866 --> 00:16:24.766
H-Hey, is everything okay?

00:16:24.866 --> 00:16:26.096
Quit the chatter!

00:16:26.133 --> 00:16:27.133
Y-Yes, sir!

00:16:27.766 --> 00:16:30.426
We are told that Lord Nene will
take care of the Shadow Wielders.

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:34.200
We are to direct all our energies
stopping the ground forces.

00:16:34.866 --> 00:16:35.526
Got it?!

00:16:35.566 --> 00:16:36.226
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

00:16:42.933 --> 00:16:44.433
There's just too many of them...

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:46.200
At this rate...

00:16:52.033 --> 00:16:54.233
Is that...Shu and the others?

00:16:56.100 --> 00:16:59.470
It guess we can't afford to
whine about it just yet...

00:17:00.300 --> 00:17:01.300
Sir!

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:02.070
What is it?!

00:17:02.333 --> 00:17:04.803
Something is approaching
from the southeast!

00:17:05.366 --> 00:17:06.526
It's a large force!

00:17:06.633 --> 00:17:07.303
What?!

00:17:09.033 --> 00:17:09.703
A new enemy?

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:13.170
No, that's...

00:17:14.233 --> 00:17:15.233
Legalas?!

00:17:16.033 --> 00:17:17.103
Reinforcements!

00:17:20.833 --> 00:17:24.273
Everybody, advance!
Annihilate the enemy!

00:17:34.066 --> 00:17:34.766
Zola!

00:17:35.066 --> 00:17:38.866
Oh my. Has she been blown to bits?

00:17:39.066 --> 00:17:41.926
You sell me awfully short!

00:17:45.333 --> 00:17:46.333
- Zola!
- Zola!

00:17:46.566 --> 00:17:48.826
But even I felt a little scared.

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:52.400
I guess that's what one must expect of
Nene and his Shadow, Chimera.

00:17:53.933 --> 00:17:56.003
Out of respect for your power,

00:17:56.033 --> 00:17:59.633
I'll let you have just a little peek
at the true strength of Killer Bat.

00:17:59.666 --> 00:18:00.826
What was that?!

00:18:09.300 --> 00:18:10.300
What is that?!

00:18:10.933 --> 00:18:13.273
Killer Bat's body is turning black.

00:18:19.900 --> 00:18:20.900
Here I go.

00:18:29.166 --> 00:18:30.396
That's fast, maro!

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:33.930
What incredible speed.
Maybe even faster than us.

00:18:40.933 --> 00:18:42.703
Nene!

00:18:47.466 --> 00:18:49.466
Hornet Assassin!

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:51.900
That's amazing...

00:18:52.233 --> 00:18:53.803
Against an opponent like Nene...

00:18:54.533 --> 00:18:57.533
She's fighting more than
an even match...

00:18:58.433 --> 00:19:01.333
But that form...

00:19:04.966 --> 00:19:09.426
That must be Killer Bat's new form
with its new power.

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:11.870
Shu!

00:19:13.166 --> 00:19:14.296
Stay focused!

00:19:14.666 --> 00:19:17.296
At this rate,
Zola will steal the whole show!

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:18.270
Huh?

00:19:18.533 --> 00:19:21.603
Are you just gonna stand there
while Nene's defeated?

00:19:23.833 --> 00:19:25.003
No way!

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:27.600
Then...

00:19:27.966 --> 00:19:28.626
Yeah!

00:19:31.133 --> 00:19:33.033
Move out of the way!

00:19:34.733 --> 00:19:35.403
Marumaro!

00:19:35.766 --> 00:19:37.396
This is our chance to free
Kluke and Bouquet!

00:19:37.700 --> 00:19:39.130
Got it, maro!

00:19:43.733 --> 00:19:44.733
Marumaro!

00:19:45.066 --> 00:19:46.566
I'll free you guys now, maro.

00:19:46.666 --> 00:19:47.666
Marumaro!

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:50.270
Maro!

00:19:50.300 --> 00:19:51.500
- Marumaro!
- Marumaro!

00:19:52.466 --> 00:19:54.626
H-Hey, look, they're coming!

00:19:56.933 --> 00:19:58.703
Maro!

00:19:58.733 --> 00:20:00.173
We won't let you!

00:20:10.300 --> 00:20:10.970
Shu!

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:12.100
I know!

00:20:14.333 --> 00:20:15.473
Conquer!

00:20:18.100 --> 00:20:19.570
Fire Crisis!

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:26.270
There!

00:20:27.433 --> 00:20:29.473
Hornet Blaster!

00:20:58.200 --> 00:20:59.670
You were too proud, Nene.

00:21:00.766 --> 00:21:01.926
What was that?!

00:21:02.233 --> 00:21:05.033
You attained power and got satisfied.

00:21:05.866 --> 00:21:10.726
You lacked effort to improve yourself.
You lost yourself amid your research.

00:21:10.766 --> 00:21:12.526
I'm saying that was your downfall!

00:21:12.966 --> 00:21:14.166
Be silent!

00:21:18.866 --> 00:21:20.066
You're finished, Nene!

00:21:21.100 --> 00:21:23.170
I won't allow that to happen!

00:21:24.633 --> 00:21:25.303
It's futile!

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:28.570
You cannot keep up with my speed.

00:21:45.833 --> 00:21:46.833
Resign yourself!

00:22:08.266 --> 00:22:14.066
I knew you'd attack me head-on at the end.
That's the kind of child you are.

00:22:14.366 --> 00:22:19.766
You may be fast, but I can stop you
if I can predict your next move.

00:22:20.266 --> 00:22:23.596
So, it seems you were
the one who was too proud.

00:22:39.966 --> 00:22:42.366
Zola!

00:24:17.100 --> 00:24:20.500
In the midst of a heated battle,
Nene changes form yet again.

00:24:20.533 --> 00:24:21.973
It doesn't matter how
strong the enemy is,

00:24:22.000 --> 00:24:23.470
if you steal their underwear,
they're sure to panic!

00:24:23.500 --> 00:24:25.330
Marumaro, go steal Nene's underwear!

00:24:25.366 --> 00:24:27.096
I have a pride too, you know, maro.

00:24:27.133 --> 00:24:28.833
If you succeed,
I'll give you some underwear!

00:24:28.866 --> 00:24:29.526
I'll do it, maro.

00:24:29.566 --> 00:24:30.566
I just felt a sudden chill...

00:24:30.600 --> 00:24:31.770
I've got a bad feeling...

00:24:31.800 --> 00:24:33.130
I'm a bit uneasy myself...

00:24:33.233 --> 00:24:35.473
Next on Blue Dragon:
The Final Battle
